# Redis HA / Sentinel notes (Phase 6)
# Single-node Compose service is fine for staging.
# Production: Redis Sentinel or managed Redis (ElastiCache / Azure Cache).

# redis.conf excerpt
# maxmemory 512mb
# maxmemory-policy allkeys-lru
# appendonly yes
# requirepass ${REDIS_PASSWORD}

# Sentinel example:
# sentinel monitor flypro-master redis-master 6379 2
# sentinel down-after-milliseconds flypro-master 5000
# sentinel failover-timeout flypro-master 10000
